# Tell me about yourself in Russian
subtitle: "Introduce yourself in Russian with words you already know: your name, age, city, work, what you love and have, and немно́го по-ру́сски."
teaches: ["phrases/about-me"]
thumb: "band \"Introduce yourself\" note \"меня́ зову́т …\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A fifth Russian story: read it all yourself","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/50-russian-review-5.cast"}

## Tell me about yourself in Russian
level: basic

    icon masha size 110 set twemoji x 90 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 90 y 360 font_size 30 hidden true
    icon tom size 110 set twemoji x 910 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 910 y 360 font_size 30 hidden true
    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Приве́т! Я Ма́ша. Как тебя́ зову́т?","gloss":"Hi! I'm Masha. What's your name?"},{"by":"a","text":"Меня́ зову́т Том. Мне три́дцать оди́н год.","gloss":"My name's Tom. I'm thirty-one."},{"by":"b","text":"О́чень прия́тно! Где ты живёшь?","gloss":"Nice to meet you! Where do you live?"},{"by":"a","text":"Я живу́ в Ло́ндоне. Я рабо́таю в рестора́не.","gloss":"I live in London. I work in a restaurant."}] size 1.5 hidden true
    dialogue talk2 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"У тебя́ есть брат и́ли сестра́?","gloss":"Do you have a brother or a sister?"},{"by":"a","text":"У меня́ есть брат. Мы игра́ем в те́ннис.","gloss":"I have a brother. We play tennis."},{"by":"b","text":"Том, ты говори́шь по-ру́сски?","gloss":"Tom, do you speak Russian?"},{"by":"a","text":"Да, немно́го. Я люблю́ Москву́!","gloss":"Yes, a little. I love Moscow!"}] size 1.5 hidden true
