    card title "About me"

B: How do you tell someone about yourself in Russian? Let's pretend Tom and I have only just met.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: Both of Tom's places take the е ending: в Ло́ндоне, в рестора́не.
    highlight talk_4_words effect underline color #8f887c part Ло́ндоне

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: У меня́ есть брат: by me there is a brother. After есть, брат keeps its plain form.
    highlight talk2_2_words effect underline color #8f887c part брат

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

B: Да, немно́го, as in lesson seven. And я люблю́ Москву́: what you love takes the object ending у.
    highlight talk2_4_words effect underline color #8f887c part Москву́

    erase talk2

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Write Tom's answers one under the other, and you have a whole introduction: seven short lines.
    draw b_tom b_tom_name ri1 r1 ri2 r2 ri3 r3 ri4 r4 ri5 r5 ri6 r6 ri7 r7

    hide r1 r2 r3 r4 r5 r6

B: Only the purple ends are his. Swap in yours, line by line, and each end still follows its rule.
    draw rc1 rc2 rc3 rc4 rc5 rc6

    erase tomcol

B: Line one: your name.
    draw s1_lbl s1_icon

    quiz "Which one starts it?" reveal.text "Меня́ зову́т ___." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1 pool false
        intro: Five questions as you build it, then your score.
        right: Меня́ зову́т: me, they call, and зову́т never changes.
        wrong: Word for word it's they call me: which word is me?
        * Я зову́т …
        * Мне зову́т …
        + Меня́ зову́т …

    erase question_1_stamp

    draw s1_frame

A: Now say yours out loud: меня́ зову́т, and your name.
    highlight s1_frame effect underline color #8f887c

    pause 3

    erase s1

B: Line two: your age. Мне, the number, and its last word decides: оди́н год, два го́да, пять лет.
    draw s2_lbl s2_icon s2_hint

    quiz "Say you're twenty-four: Мне два́дцать четы́ре ___. Which word?" reveal.text "Мне два́дцать четы́ре го́да." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Четы́ре goes with два and три, so го́да.
        wrong: Only the last word counts, and here it's четы́ре.
        * год
        + го́да
        * лет

    erase question_2_stamp

    draw s2_frame

    erase s2

B: Line three: where you live. Я живу́ в, then your city with the place ending.
    draw s3_lbl s3_icon

    ask "Say you live in Paris, Пари́ж. Type the last word: Я живу́ в ___." answer ["париже"] reveal.text "Я живу́ в Пари́же." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Пари́же: Пари́ж ends in a consonant, so it adds е, like в Ло́ндоне.
        wrong: Start from Пари́ж; after в, what does a city add?

    erase question_3_stamp

    draw s3_frame

A: Mostly, a city in a consonant adds е, like П (@draw s3_hint@)ари́ж, and a city in а swaps it: в Москве́.

B: But a foreign one in о, like О́сло, stays as it is.
    draw s3_hint2

    hide s3_frame

B: Now yours, out loud: я живу́ в, and your city.
    draw s3_blank

    pause 3

    erase s3

B: Line four: your work. Я рабо́таю в, and the place, with that same е.
    draw s4_lbl s4_icon

    quiz "Say you work at a school, шко́ла: Я рабо́таю ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "Я рабо́таю в шко́ле." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: В шко́ле: you're there, so the а makes way for е.
        wrong: Are you on your way there, or working there?
        + в шко́ле
        * в шко́лу
        * в шко́ла

    erase question_4_stamp

    draw s4_frame

A: Or yours: в ба́нке, в магази́не, в университе́те.
    draw s4_more

    erase s4

    draw s5_lbl s5_icon

B: Line five: what you love. Я люблю́, then the t (@draw s5_hint@)hing: an а becomes у, and a word in a consonant stays, я люблю́ чай.

    quiz "Say you love music, му́зыка: Я люблю́ ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "Я люблю́ му́зыку." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Му́зыку: the thing you love takes the object ending, so а becomes у.
        wrong: Think of Tom's я люблю́ Москву́: what happened to the а?
        * му́зыка
        * му́зыке
        + му́зыку

    erase question_5_stamp

    draw s5_frame

    hide s5_hint

A: Or a verb, straight from the dictionary: я люблю́ чита́ть, я люблю́ игра́ть в те́ннис.
    draw s5_more

    erase s5

    draw s6_lbl s6_icon

B: Line six: what you have. У меня́ есть, and the t (@draw s6_frame@)hing just as it is: у меня́ есть брат, у меня́ есть ко́шка.

    erase s6

    draw s7_lbl s7_icon

A: And line seven, the same for (@draw s7_frame@) everyone: я говорю́ немно́го по-ру́сски.

    erase s7

    draw recap parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase recap

B: Here's your frame. Pause now, and say all seven lines out loud, with your own ends.
    group kit members ["ki1","k1","ki2","k2","ki3","k3","ki4","k4","ki5","k5","ki6","k6","ki7","k7"]

    highlight k1 effect underline color #7a4f9a

    pause 0.8

    highlight k2 effect underline color #7a4f9a

    pause 0.8

    highlight k3 effect underline color #7a4f9a

    pause 0.8

    highlight k4 effect underline color #7a4f9a

    pause 0.8

    highlight k5 effect underline color #7a4f9a

    pause 0.8

    highlight k6 effect underline color #7a4f9a

    pause 0.8

    highlight k7 effect underline color #7a4f9a

    pause 0.8

B: No new grammar at all: just the rules you k (@highlight k2 k3 k5 effect underline color #7a4f9a@)now, год or лет, the place е, the object у.

    hide kit

A: О́чень прия́тно! Next time, one last story, made from all fifty lessons. Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 190 set twemoji x 300 y 420 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_tom size 190 set twemoji x 700 y 420 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    text end_q "О́чень прия́тно!" say "О́чень прия́тно!" x 500 y 600 font_size 64
